{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "默认模块",
    "description": "通义万相视频生成 API 提供文生视频、图生视频、首尾帧生视频等功能。\n\n## 主要功能\n- **文生视频**: 根据文本提示词生成视频\n- **图生视频**: 基于首帧图像生成视频\n- **首尾帧生视频**: 根据首尾帧图像生成过渡视频\n\n## 异步处理说明\n所有视频生成任务都是异步处理：\n1. 创建任务，获取 task_id\n2. 使用 task_id 轮询查询结果，直到任务完成\n\n## 支持的模型\n### 文生视频模型\n- wan2.5-t2v-preview: 支持5秒/10秒，支持自动配音\n- wan2.2-t2v-flash: 5秒固定时长，极速版\n- wan2.2-t2v-plus: 5秒固定时长，专业版\n- wanx2.1-t2v-turbo: 5秒固定时长\n- wanx2.1-t2v-plus: 5秒固定时长\n\n### 图生视频模型\n- wan2.5-i2v-preview: 支持5秒/10秒，支持音频\n- wan2.2-i2v-flash: 5秒固定时长，极速版\n- wan2.2-i2v-plus: 5秒固定时长，专业版\n- wanx2.1-i2v-turbo: 支持3/4/5秒\n- wanx2.1-i2v-plus: 5秒固定时长\n\n### 首尾帧生视频模型\n- wan2.2-kf2v-flash: 5秒固定时长，支持480P/720P/1080P\n- wanx2.1-kf2v-plus: 5秒固定时长，仅支持720P\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "tags": [],
  "paths": {
    "/seedance/v3/contents/generations/tasks": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "任务提交",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "",
        "tags": [],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "模型名称",
                    "enum": [
                      "doubao-seedance-1-5-pro-251215"
                    ]
                  },
                  "content": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "type": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "const": "text",
                            "example": "text"
                          },
                          "text": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "提示词"
                          }
                        },
                        "title": "文本",
                        "required": [
                          "type",
                          "text"
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "type": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "const": "image_url",
                            "example": "image_url"
                          },
                          "image_url": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                              "url": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "title": "参考图链接"
                              }
                            },
                            "required": [
                              "url"
                            ]
                          },
                          "role": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "图片的位置或用途",
                            "enum": [
                              "first_frame",
                              "last_frame",
                              "reference_image"
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        "title": "参考图",
                        "required": [
                          "type",
                          "image_url",
                          "role"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "return_last_frame": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "title": "是否返回尾帧图"
                  },
                  "generate_audio": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "title": "是否生成音频"
                  },
                  "resolution": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "视频分辨率",
                    "enum": [
                      "480p",
                      "720p",
                      "1080p"
                    ],
                    "default": "720p"
                  },
                  "ratio": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "title": "视频宽高比",
                    "enum": [
                      "1:1",
                      "3:4",
                      "4:3",
                      "9:16",
                      "16:9",
                      "21:9",
                      "adaptive"
                    ]
                  },
                  "duration": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "title": "视频时长",
                    "minimum": 4,
                    "maximum": 12
                  },
                  "camera_fixed": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "title": "是否固定摄像头",
                    "description": "参考图生视频场景不支持"
                  },
                  "watermark": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "title": "是否包含水印"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "model",
                  "content"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {}
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "title": "任务Id"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "id"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/seedance/v3/contents/generations/tasks/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "查询视频任务",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "",
        "tags": [],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "model": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "status": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "queued",
                        "running",
                        "cancelled",
                        "succeeded",
                        "failed",
                        "expired"
                      ]
                    },
                    "content": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "video_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "title": "生成视频的 URL，格式为 mp4。为保障信息安全，生成的视频会在24小时后被清理，请及时转存"
                        },
                        "last_frame_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "title": "视频的尾帧图像 URL。有效期为 24小时，请及时转存",
                          "description": "设置 \"return_last_frame\": true 时，会返回该参数"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "video_url"
                      ]
                    },
                    "usage": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "completion_tokens": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "title": "模型输出视频花费的 token 数量"
                        },
                        "total_tokens": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "title": "本次请求消耗的总 token 数量",
                          "description": "视频生成模型不统计输入 token，输入 token 为 0，故 total_tokens=completion_tokens"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "completion_tokens",
                        "total_tokens"
                      ]
                    },
                    "created_at": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "updated_at": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "seed": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "resolution": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "ratio": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "duration": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "framespersecond": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "service_tier": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "execution_expires_after": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "title": "任务超时阈值，单位：秒"
                    },
                    "generate_audio": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "draft": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "title": "错误信息",
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "message"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "id",
                    "model",
                    "status"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "id": "cgt-2025******-****",
                  "model": "doubao-seedance-1-5-pro-251215",
                  "status": "succeeded",
                  "content": {
                    "video_url": "https://ark-content-generation-cn-beijing.tos-cn-beijing.volces.com/xxx"
                  },
                  "usage": {
                    "completion_tokens": 108900,
                    "total_tokens": 108900
                  },
                  "created_at": 1743414619,
                  "updated_at": 1743414673,
                  "seed": 10,
                  "resolution": "720p",
                  "ratio": "16:9",
                  "duration": 5,
                  "framespersecond": 24,
                  "service_tier": "default",
                  "execution_expires_after": 172800,
                  "generate_audio": true,
                  "draft": false
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
